  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "もくげきほうこくは　ごくわずか。ひばしらを　ふき　あばれる　すがたのみじかい　えいぞうが　そんざいする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "목격 보고는 매우 드물다. 불기둥을 뿜어내며 날뛰는 모습이 담긴 짧은 영상이 존재한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "目擊報告極為稀少。有將牠噴出火柱大鬧的樣子拍攝下來的短片。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cette créature n’a été que rarement aperçue, mais elle apparaît dans une courte vidéo où on la voit enrager et faire jaillir des piliers de feu.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es gibt nur sehr wenige bestätigte Sichtungen, doch es existiert ein kurzes Video, auf dem es umherwütet und Flammensäulen ausspeit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Apenas constan avistamientos de este Pokémon, pero existe una breve grabación donde aparece desbocado y escupiendo ráfagas de fuego.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È stato avvistato pochissime volte. Esiste però un breve filmato che lo mostra sputare colonne di fuoco in preda all’ira.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "There are scant few reports of this creature being sighted. One short video shows it rampaging and spouting pillars of flame.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "目撃報告は　ごくわずか。火柱を　噴き　暴れる　姿の短い　映像が　存在する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "目击报告十分少。有把它喷出火柱大闹的样子拍摄下来的短片存在。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Apenas constan avistamientos de este Pokémon, pero existe una breve grabación donde aparece desbocado y escupiendo ráfagas de fuego.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かせきから　ふくげんされた　エンテイと　オカルトざっしが　けいさいしたあやしい　ポケモンに　にている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "화석에서 복원된 앤테이라며 오컬트 잡지에 게재됐던 수상한 포켓몬을 닮았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與超自然雜誌刊登的可疑寶可夢長得很相似。報導中的寶可夢據說是從化石復原的炎帝。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble à un Pokémon étrange qu’une revue sur les phénomènes paranormaux présentait comme un Entei ressuscité à partir d’un fossile.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ähnelt einem fragwürdigen Pokémon, das von einer esoterischen Zeitschrift als ein aus einem Fossil wiedererwecktes Entei bezeichnet wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se asemeja a un supuesto Pokémon descrito en una revista esotérica como \"un Entei restaurado a partir de un fósil\".",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ricorda un Pokémon che, stando alla rivista di paranormale che lo ha descritto, sarebbe un Entei rigenerato a partire da un fossile.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It resembles an eerie Pokémon once shown in a paranormal magazine. That Pokémon was said to be an Entei regenerated from a fossil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "化石から　復元された　エンテイと　オカルト雑誌が　掲載した怪しい　ポケモンに　似ている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "与超自然杂志所刊登的可疑的宝可梦很相似。该杂志声称那是从化石中复原的炎帝。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
